 * CLAIM (Routh/Lienard-Chipart Hopf signature): at the boundary Delta_3=0, with a1>0,a3>0,
 * a4>0, the value W=a3/a1 (encoded a1*W=a3) makes BOTH Ev(W)=0 and Od(W)=0, i.e. i*sqrt(W)
 * is a pure imaginary root pair and W=omega^2>0.  Proof of Ev=0: a1^2*Ev = (a1*W)^2 -
 * a2*(a1*W)*a1 + a1^2*a4 = a3^2 - a1*a2*a3 + a1^2*a4 = -(Delta_3) = 0.
 * This is the exact mechanism of the model's Sigma_H={Delta_9=0,...}, certified at deg 4. */
